radix (51.0.0~rc3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add square (^) and square root (√) keys to the Basic keypad in place of
    the x / f(x) menu buttons.
  * Report tokenizer spans as UTF-8 byte ranges and clamp error highlighting
    to character boundaries; support implicit multiplication before a
    prefix square root (5√5 = 5×√5).

 -- hakergeniusz <radix@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 18:45:00 +0000

